## Interface: 11200
# ^ WoW vanilla 1.12 client (Lua 5.0). This is the vanilla port of the addon;
#   the Classic Era 1.15 variant lives in addon/WowMobile.
## Title: WoW Mobile (Vanilla)
## Notes: Portrait touch UI overhaul for streaming WoW 1.12 to a phone (1080x1920 window, 1080x1080 world viewport + control deck).
## Author: WoW Mobile project
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: WowMobileDB

# Load order is the dependency order: Core provides the namespace/bus/timers,
# Config the saved variables, Blizzard the default-UI banishment, Viewport the
# world square and deck rect, Deck the panel/scroller/menu infrastructure.
# Bar and HUD modules then stack bottom-up inside the deck (each anchors to
# the frame the previous module published in WM.Layout; Pet also anchors its
# status strip to the unit row UnitFrames publishes), and the panel modules
# only depend on Deck. WorldMap reflows Blizzard's map over the deck; Talents
# reflows the FrameXML TalentFrame into the world square. Settings loads last
# because its panel drives Config + Viewport. (No Compat.lua in this port:
# the 1.12 API is called directly.)
Core.lua
Config.lua
Blizzard.lua
Viewport.lua
Deck.lua
ActionBars.lua
QuickBar.lua
XPBar.lua
UnitFrames.lua
CastBar.lua
Auras.lua
Pet.lua
Minimap.lua
Chat.lua
BottomSheet.lua
Spellbook.lua
CharacterPanel.lua
QuestLog.lua
Bags.lua
WorldMap.lua
Talents.lua
Settings.lua
